    "value": "2/7"
  },
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.amc-10a-2006-p6.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Taking the seventh root of both sides gives \\((7x)^2 = 14x,\\) so \\(49x^2 = 14x.\\) Since \\(x \\neq 0,\\) divide by \\(x\\) to get \\(49x = 14,\\) hence \\(x = \\dfrac{2}{7}.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is B.",
